    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HamsterCraft is a fast-paced, cheese-fueled Tower Defense game where strategy meets silliness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your defense using a growing roster of Heroic Hamsters\u2014Each with unique attacks, upgrades, and playstyles. Face off against quirky enemy waves, unlock powerful trinkets, and climb the cheese ladder to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816380/extras/32d394e76e46d570275abdf2fff58251.avif?t=1751635127\" width=616 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83e\uddc0 <strong>Campaign!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0A carefully crafted journey across unique levels where strategy meets story. Master each\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 stage and defend your cheese empire one wave at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Endless - ARAM Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Jump into a wild, procedurally generated battlefield where no two runs are ever the same!\u00a0 \u00a0Infinite scaling \u2014 pure chaos, infinite fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Ranked Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Climb the global leaderboard! Test your skills in seasonal runs with fair rules, competitive\u00a0 \u00a0loadouts, and leaderboard rewards. Strategy matters \u2014 but so does style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Daily Quest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fresh challenges every day! Complete bite-sized missions for cheese crystal, boosts, and\u00a0 \u00a0bonus goodies. Perfect for a quick squeaky session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83c\udfc5 <strong>Achievements!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Unlock hamster glory! From silly to skillful, collect dozens of in-game achievements that\u00a0 \u00a0show off your cheese defense legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>In-Game Shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Drip your defense! Spend your hard-earned crystal cheese on, skins, and trinkets \u2014 all purely\u00a0 \u00a0cosmetic, all squeak-approved. No pay-to-win, just play-to-stylize.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- </strong>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Come Get Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Competitive... but still squeaky fun!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect blend of lighthearted chaos and real strategic depth \u2014 for casual defenders and leaderboard legends alike.</p>",
